      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹43.27 (down from ₹54.33 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹521.1m (down 11% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹32.7m (down 20% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 6.3% (down from 7.0% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 8% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 27% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
